  "notes": "{四|よ}つ (four) plus {子|こ} (child); こ voices to ご in the compound.\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {双子|ふたご}: twins\n- {三|みつ}つ{子|ご}: triplets\n- {五|いつ}つ{子|ご}: quintuplets\n\nUSAGE:\nThese multiple-birth words use the native counting series ({双子|ふたご}, {三|みつ}つ{子|ご}, {四|よ}つ{子|ご}, {五|いつ}つ{子|ご}), not the Sino-Japanese numbers.",
